      "created_at": "2017-01-19T19:49:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I was playing with SkyScraper &amp; Fixer against the Chairman, and I had SkyScraper play Catch-a-Ride, using Fixer to atttack.</p><p>Fixer swung for the fences, and then... nothing.&nbsp; No irreducible damage, no choice of who to do the 2 damage to.</p><p>Is this a bug, or is there something I'm missing here?</p><p>Fixer killed off the last target, but there were still 3 targets that he'd dealt damage to that were in play.</p>",
