      "created_at": "2017-01-19T19:59:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Was the first target you hit with it destroyed? &nbsp;The first target (or last target) you hit would be the one most likely to cause the computer to not process the second hit, because the target didn't survive the initial hit.</p>",
