      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-01-19T22:16:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Was the first target you hit with it destroyed? &nbsp;The first target (or last target) you hit would be the one most likely to cause the computer to not process the second hit, because the target didn't survive the initial hit.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The first target was the Operative (I think MAY have been a Corrupt Cop who was killed, can't remember), who was still in one piece (then.&nbsp; I turned her to paste later).</p>\n<p>The last target was a mook (not a Corrupt Cop, not a Goons).</p>\n<p>I'll see if I can replicate the issue later.</p>",
